---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Eyebrow from '../components/Eyebrow.astro';
import Waveform from '../components/Waveform.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import aboutImg from '../assets/tiffany_about_new.jpg';
---

<Layout title="About | Tiffany Webb" description="Meet Tiffany Webb. Discover her journey from Chicago to frontline behavioral health prevention." theme="ink">
  <main class="page-content">
    
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="inner-hero theme-ink">
      <Waveform opacity={0.06} flipX={true} variant="B" />
      <div class="container hero-grid reveal-up">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <Eyebrow>About</Eyebrow>
          <h1 class="inner-hero-title">Chicago soul, <span class="italic-accent">Louisiana heart.</span></h1>
          <p class="inner-hero-sub text-micro">Community Impact Strategist &middot; Public Health Educator</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-image-wrap reveal-in" style="transition-delay: 0.3s;">
           <Image src={aboutImg} alt="Tiffany Webb Portrait" class="about-hero-img" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Her Roots -->
    <section class="roots section-pad theme-ink">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="glass-card prose-column reveal-up">
          <p>Chicago-born and raised, with deep Louisiana family roots, Tiffany grew up between two places that shaped how she works. A city that taught her resilience and directness. A family culture that taught her hospitality — that you meet people where they are, and you feed them before you ask them anything.</p>
          
          <p>Hers was a family that believed in literacy, healing, and empowerment. Books on the table. Doors open. Somebody always being helped through something. That inheritance is what she brought into public health, and it is still how she works: start where the person actually is, not where the pamphlet assumes they are.</p>
          
          <p>She has spent more than fifteen years and over four thousand hours doing gambling-prevention outreach. Not from a conference room — in schools, clinics, community centres, and the rooms most prevention programs never reach. She came to it through behavioral health, and she stayed because she kept meeting families who had no language for what was happening to them.</p>
          
          <p>Gambling harm hides. It doesn't smell like alcohol or show up on a drug test. It shows up as a missing paycheck, a second job nobody understands, a marriage that quietly stops working. By the time most families name it, they have been carrying it alone for years.</p>
          
          <p>That is the silence her work exists to break. Her approach blends behavioral-health expertise, community outreach, and an entrepreneurial streak that turned a personal mission into a brand people wear. Every part of it points the same direction: turning pain into power for the people other programs overlook.</p>
          
          <blockquote class="pull-quote">"When we rise, we rise together."</blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Professional Journey Timeline -->
    <section class="journey section-pad theme-ink">
      <div class="container reveal-up">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <Eyebrow>The Path Here</Eyebrow>
          <h2 class="section-title">Where all <span class="italic-accent">paths meet.</span></h2>
          <p class="subtitle mx-auto">Behavioral health taught her how harm works. Community outreach taught her how trust works. Public health education taught her how to scale a message. Prevention is where all three meet.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="timeline-grid stagger-group">
          <div class="timeline-item glass-card stagger-item">
            <span class="timeline-num">01</span>
            <h3>Behavioral Health</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item glass-card stagger-item">
            <span class="timeline-num">02</span>
            <h3>Community Outreach</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item glass-card stagger-item">
            <span class="timeline-num">03</span>
            <h3>Gambling Prevention</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item glass-card stagger-item">
            <span class="timeline-num">04</span>
            <h3>Public Health Education</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item glass-card stagger-item">
            <span class="timeline-num">05</span>
            <h3>Partnership Building</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item glass-card stagger-item">
            <span class="timeline-num">06</span>
            <h3>Community Impact Strategist</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Mission & Vision -->
    <section class="core section-pad theme-ink relative">
      <Waveform opacity={0.03} />
      <div class="container grid-2">
        <div class="mission-vision glass-card reveal-up">
          <Eyebrow>Mission</Eyebrow>
          <p class="mission-statement">So that no individual, family, or community faces gambling harm in silence, shame, or isolation — because prevention begins with a conversation.</p>
          
          <div class="mt-12">
            <Eyebrow>Vision</Eyebrow>
            <h2 class="mb-4">Where this is going.</h2>
            <ul class="vision-list">
              <li><strong>National speaking:</strong> Bringing prevention conversations to stages, campuses, and conferences across the country.</li>
              <li><strong>Training & education:</strong> Equipping clinicians, educators, and frontline teams with tools that survive contact with real life.</li>
              <li><strong>Community:</strong> Building something people can join, wear, and carry into their own conversations.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="values glass-card reveal-in" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
          <Eyebrow>Values</Eyebrow>
          <h2 class="mb-4">What she works from.</h2>
          <ul class="values-list">
            <li><strong>Faith</strong> — the belief that people can change, including the ones everyone else gave up on.</li>
            <li><strong>Family</strong> — where prevention starts, and where harm is felt first and longest.</li>
            <li><strong>Community</strong> — nobody recovers alone, and nobody prevents alone either.</li>
            <li><strong>Purpose</strong> — turning lived understanding into practical service.</li>
            <li><strong>Impact</strong> — measured in conversations started, not talks delivered.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    
    <!-- GambleFreeGear -->
    <section class="gfg-section section-pad theme-ink relative" id="gamblefreegear">
      <Waveform opacity={0.05} flipX={true} variant="C" />
      <div class="container text-center reveal-up">
        <div class="glass-card gfg-card">
          <Eyebrow>A Venture by Tiffany Webb</Eyebrow>
          <h2 class="section-title">GambleFreeGear</h2>
          <p class="subtitle mx-auto mt-4 mb-8">
            Prevention you can wear. Tiffany Webb is the founder of GambleFreeGear, an apparel brand designed to break the silence on gambling addiction and start conversations in the communities that need them most.
          </p>
          <Button href="https://inpowerimports.com" variant="primary" className="magnetic-btn" target="_blank">Visit GambleFreeGear &rarr;</Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Closing CTA -->
    <section class="closing section-pad theme-ink text-center reveal-up">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Let's start a conversation.</h2>
        <p class="subtitle mx-auto mb-8">Whether you're planning a conference, building a prevention program, or trying to reach a community that hasn't responded to anything yet — that's the work.</p>
        <Button href="/book" variant="primary" className="magnetic-btn">Invite Tiffany to Speak &rarr;</Button>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-content {
    background: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--sp-6);
  }

  .section-pad {
    padding: var(--sp-24) 0;
  }

  /* Typography Utilities */
  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: rgba(231, 224, 207, 0.8);
    max-width: 800px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .mx-auto { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
  .text-center { text-align: center; }
  .mb-4 { margin-bottom: var(--sp-4); }
  .mb-8 { margin-bottom: var(--sp-8); }
  .mb-12 { margin-bottom: var(--sp-12); }
  .mt-4 { margin-top: var(--sp-4); }
  .mt-12 { margin-top: var(--sp-12); }
  .relative { position: relative; }

  /* Hero */
  .inner-hero {
    position: relative;
    padding: calc(var(--sp-24) + 80px) 0 var(--sp-12);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--sp-12);
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  @media (min-width: 992px) {
    .hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .inner-hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-6);
    color: var(--color-ivory);
  }

  .inner-hero-sub {
    color: var(--color-gold);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .hero-image-wrap {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
    border-radius: 120px 16px 120px 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(217, 162, 58, 0.4);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    position: relative;
  }

  .about-hero-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  /* Glass Cards */
  .glass-card {
    background: rgba(20, 18, 14, 0.45);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(120%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(120%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: var(--sp-12);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 0.6s ease;
  }

  .glass-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
  }

  /* Roots Prose */
  .prose-column {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .prose-column p {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #e7e0cf;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-6);
  }

  .pull-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    color: var(--color-gold);
    line-height: 1.4;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-gold);
    padding-left: var(--sp-8);
    margin: var(--sp-12) 0;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* Timeline Grid */
  .timeline-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--sp-6);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .timeline-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .timeline-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .timeline-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--sp-4);
    padding: var(--sp-8);
  }

  .timeline-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--color-gold);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .timeline-item h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-ivory);
  }

  /* Core Layout */
  .grid-2 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--sp-8);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  @media (min-width: 992px) {
    .grid-2 {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: var(--sp-12);
    }
  }

  .mission-statement {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--color-ivory);
    margin-top: var(--sp-4);
  }

  .vision-list, .values-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--sp-6);
    color: rgba(231, 224, 207, 0.9);
  }

  .vision-list li, .values-list li {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding-left: var(--sp-6);
    position: relative;
  }

  .vision-list li::before, .values-list li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 10px;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-gold);
  }

  .vision-list strong, .values-list strong {
    color: var(--color-ivory);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  /* Gamble Free Gear */
  .gfg-card {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--sp-16) var(--sp-8);
  }
</style>
